    "The Free Variable is 'outside' the closed system yet somehow intervening within it; the boundary between transcendent and immanent remains unclear.",
    "PKD claims 'proof' via Christopher's birth defect information, yet acknowledges the computer 'openly overrules its own program'; proof requires consistent rules but the system is shown as rule-violating.",
    "The Godhead is declared 'simple' while the Macro-Brain is 'infinitely complex'; the relationship between simplicity and complexity remains unresolved.",
    "PKD affirms all religions teach salvation identically, yet their cosmologies differ radically (Christian atonement vs. Buddhist Maya vs. Zoroastrian dualism); universalism vs. particularism unresolved.",
