  "evidence_quotes": [
    "The truth, evidently, is that the Holy Spirit so-to-speak transported me back to Acts, producing the perplexing situation of my being here + now, + there + then simultaneously.",
    "So in 2-3-74 I was given a major change to see the total system (which gnosis the Paraclete is specifically stipulated in the N.T. to be able to provide + to do so). It would not seem as if anything was withheld from one as an object of knowledge; I knew what the Paraclete knew: it unfolded all the secrets of creation to me including knowledge of the Godhead (the Vast Void).",
    "Our reality is a program-in-process which repeatedly gets revised in an effort to abolish the stagnant clot (or complex) whose presence renders the computer psychotic (to some degree). So withing the program exists one variable not a product of the initial pair of para-truths of the program which set its flip flop dialectic in motion.",
    "True perception on our part is totally dependent on the gracious aid of the Free Variable from outside our closed program. It is axiomatic that nothing arising from within the program conveys any overview of the actual nature of the program + our condition is a function of it.",
    "By studying the fact of Christ's voluntary death we can"
  ],
